# ── Secrets (NEVER commit these) ──────────────────────────────────────────
.env
# Catch every .env variant -- backups, copies and dumps leak the same
# secrets as .env itself. apps/api/.env.backup (29 keys incl.
# POSTGRES_PASSWORD, REDIS_PASSWORD, MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD, JWT_PRIVATE_KEY)
# was sitting untracked and NOT ignored: .env.bak was listed, .env.backup
# was not. One `git add -A` from entering history permanently.
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
.env.local
.env.*.local
.env.development.local
.env.production.local
*.prod.env
secrets.prod.env

